      "description": "Open Positions | Middlebury College Skip to content We use cookies and other technologies to better understand a visitor's experience and to help improve our websites. By continuing to use the website, you consent to Middlebury's use of cookies and other technologies as outlined in our Privacy Policy . Close Middlebury College Menu Admissions & Financial Aid Application Instructions and Deadlines Campus and Virtual Visits Counselor Information Reports and Policies Connect with Admissions Academics Majors and Minors Programs and Opportunities Resources and Centers Course Information Advising Library Museum of Art Academics Calendars Academic Affairs Student Life Center for Student Success Academic Life Annual Campus Events General Information Arts Planning Ahead Athletics Get Involved Community Living Community Standards Dean of Students Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion Center for Health and Wellness Student Activities New Student Orientation Athletics Arts Events Performing Arts Series Box Office Stay in Touch Accessibility Services Middlebury International Search Midd Stories Calendar of Events Offices and Services Giving Apply Visit Financial Aid Search Search Search Middlebury College Academics Academic Affairs For Faculty Prospective Faculty Open Positions Academic Affairs In this section Academic Affairs For Faculty New Faculty Prospective Faculty Open Positions Reviews Curriculum Development and Research Events News Academic Administration Middlebury College is an equal opportunity employer, committed to hiring a diverse faculty to complement the increasing diversity of the student body. All faculty recruiting is done at the department level.  If you have questions about a particular position, please contact the department chair, program director, or academic coordinator . The College provides several resources to help prospective faculty find housing, child care and spousal employment information. Please contact the Vice President for Academic Affairs office if more assistance is needed. Tenure Track Position Openings (beginning Fall 2027) Department of Chinese - Assistant Professor - The Department of Chinese invites applicants for a full-time tenure track position beginning fall 2027 Department of Italian - Assistant Professor - The Department of Italian invites applicants for a full-time tenure track position beginning fall 2027 Department of Luso-Hispanic - Assistant Professor - The Department of Luso-Hispanic studies invites applicants for a full-time tenure track position beginning fall 2027 Department of Philosophy - Assistant Professor - The Department of Philosophy invites applicants for a full-time tenure track position beginning fall 2027 Department of Physics - Assistant Professor - The Department of Physics and Astronomy invites applicants for a full-time tenure track position beginning fall 2027 Department of Political Science - Assistant Professor - The Department of Political Science invites applicants for a full-time tenure track position beginning in fall 2027 Department of Religion - Assistant Professor - The Department of Religion invites applicants for a full-time tenure track positions beginning fall 2027 Department of Russian - Assistant Professor - The Department of Russian invites applicants for a full-time tenure track position beginning fall 2027 Department of Studio Art - Assistant Professor - The Department of Studio Art invites applicants for a full-time tenure-track position beginning fall 2027 Term Position Openings (beginning Academic Year 2027-28) Department of Biology - Visiting Assistant Professor - The Department of Biology invites applicants for a two-year full-time position beginning fall 2027 Department of Biology - Visiting Assistant Professor - The Department of Biology invites applicants for a three-year full-time position beginning fall 2027 Help shape Middlebury’s future. Make a Gift Middlebury College Middlebury, VT 05753 802-443-5000 Admissions 802-443